hi-minh.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ho Chi Minh</span><span class="tp">1890–1969</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/alfonso-garcia-robles"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/alfonso-garcia-robles.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Alfonso García Robles</span><span class="tp">1911–1991</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/islam-karimov"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/islam-karimov.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Islam Karimov</span><span class="tp">1938–2016</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
